    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eseriani oo ntarasi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keishieki olwuasa o enkitokoos",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eiputa enkop enye enkosholai o sahabu, nemeeta ilchumat lenye eneiting'ie; neiputa nkop enye mbartan, nemeeta eneiting'ie ngarrin enye oo mbartan te nkumoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eiputa enkop enye nkitanyaanyukot oo nkaitin, neirrugokino ninche ina siaai oo nkaik enye, ina naitobira ilkimojik lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keitoborri iltung'ana, neitadouni iltung'ana - mipalaki ninche! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 6.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TH.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ils 1.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Tijing'a atua endapidapoi, nilo aisudori ti atua enterit ailany ina kituriata o Laitoriani, nilany ina kitoo e nkisisa enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina kitokoos oo ltung'ana naa keitadouni, ore ilo wuasa loo ltung'ana naa keitoborri; neaku Olaitoriani ake eitaae kitok te ina olong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eeta Olaitoriani loo lororani enkolong nagilunore ilo pooki owuasa neitokoos, agilunore ina pooki nailepieki aadumu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agilunore lelo tarakua pooki le Lebanon, lelo adoru ooilepieki shumata, negilunore lelo keek oogol le Bashan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "negilunore lelo doinyo adoru pooki, negilunore nena doinyo naaitokoos pooki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "negilunore pooki wueji neika, o pooki suntai nasheta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "negilunore imelin pooki e Tarshishi negilunore pooki toki e nkarriyiano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkitokoos oo ltung'ana neitadouni, ore ilo wuasa loo ltung'ana neitadouni abori; neaku Olaitoriani ake eitaae kitok te ina olong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nena kitanyaanyukot oo nkaitin neishieki tukul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejing iltung'ana nkapuniaa oo ndapidapo, o ngumot e nkop, aailany ina kituriata o Laitoriani, neilany ina kitoo e nkisisa enye, te nedumunye aiture enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore akenya te ina olong nenang'aa iltung'ana aaiturraa nena kitanyaanyukot enye e nkosholai o nena kitanyaanyukot enye oo nkaitin e sahabu, apa naaitobirakita ate pee eserem, nenang'aki ilkirrumun o sarampalani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pee etum aatijing ilbaat loo ndapidapo o nkapuniaa oo soito sapuki aailany ina kituriata o Laitoriani o ina kitoo e nkisisa enye, te nedumunye ninye aiture enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbelekenyayu tung'uai tung'ani laa ore nkumeishin enyena netii enkiyang'et, Amaa kole tipat ninye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
